    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>A scatter of leaves hangs where the blow found you. You step out of a second swirl a few paces away.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Reaction</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Self after a visible attack resolves against you.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Magic / Movement / Defense</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>After the attack resolves, teleport to a visible free supported square within 3 squares.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30/design/cards/behind-the-hawthorn.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/behind-the-hawthorn.md</a> at <code>25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30</code>.</p></section>",
